{
 "id": "mk-c2-1",
 "src": "估價_綜合模擬卷二.html",
 "idx": 0,
 "group": "cost",
 "q_html": "一、試說明成本法估價之意義、應用時機及估價程序。並依「不動產估價技術規則」，說明折舊之定義，以及定率遞減法（定率法）之計算公式，試以一棟建物為例：建物重建成本為 800 萬元，耐用年數 50 年，殘值率 10%，已使用 20 年，請以定率遞減法求算折舊後之建物現值。（25分）",
 "ans_html": "<div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>一、成本法之意義</h4>\n        <p>成本法係求取勘估標的於價格日期之重建成本或重置成本，扣減其累積折舊額或其他應扣除部分，以推算勘估標的價格之估價方法。（技術規則§48）</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>二、應用時機</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>無市場交易案例或案例缺乏可比性（如特殊工業廠房、寺廟）</li>\n          <li>新建建物或完工不久之建物</li>\n          <li>公益性設施估價（學校、圖書館）</li>\n          <li>保險金額之估算、徵收補償</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>三、估價程序（§49）</h4>\n        <ol>\n          <li>蒐集資料，並至現場勘察</li>\n          <li>調查、整理、比較、分析成本資料及相關費用</li>\n          <li>選擇適當方法推算營造施工費（§54～§56：直接法、間接法）</li>\n          <li>推算設計費、資本利息、利潤等其他成本，計算總成本（§52）</li>\n          <li>計算累積折舊額（§68）</li>\n          <li>計算成本價格：建物＝總成本－累積折舊；土地＝總成本（§69）</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>四、折舊之意義（學理；計算依技術規則§65～§68）</h4>\n        <p>折舊係指建物因物理性、機能性及經濟性因素，致價值減損。技術規則規定：折舊以<strong>經濟耐用年數</strong>為主（§65）、殘餘價格率原則不超過10%（§67）、累積折舊額依建物特性選擇等速、初期加速或初期減速折舊路徑（§68）。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>五、定率遞減法（屬初期加速折舊路徑，§68）</h4>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">殘值率</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">(1 − 年折舊率)<sup>耐用年數</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">∴ 年折舊率 r</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">1</span><span class=\"kf-op\">−</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">(殘值率)<sup>1/耐用年數</sup></span></div></div>\n        <p>殘值率 10% = 0.1；耐用年數 N = 50</p>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">r</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1</span><span class=\"kf-op\">−</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">(0.1)¹⁄⁵⁰</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">1</span><span class=\"kf-op\">−</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">0.1<sup>0.02</sup></span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">0.1<sup>0.02</sup></span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">e<sup>0.02 × ln0.1</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">e<sup>0.02 × (−2.3026)</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">e<sup>−0.046052</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">≈</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">0.9550</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">∴ r</span><span class=\"kf-op\">≈</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1</span><span class=\"kf-op\">−</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">0.9550</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">0.0450（年折舊率約 4.50%）</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">已使用20年</span><span class=\"kf-op\">→</span><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">成數</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">(1 − r)²⁰</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">(0.9550)²⁰</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">(0.9550)²⁰</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">e<sup>20 × ln(1−r)</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">e<sup>20 × (−0.046052)</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">e<sup>−0.9210</sup></span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">≈</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">0.3981</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">建物現值</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">800</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">0.3981</span><span class=\"kf-op\">≈</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>318.5 萬元</strong></span></div></div>\n        <p style=\"font-size:.82rem;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-top:6px;\">（若考試給定 r=4.5%，則 0.955²⁰≈0.39817，建物現值≈318.5萬，依題目給定值為準）</p>\n      </div>"
}